{"id":"paquete","lemma":"paquete","pos":"noun","rank":1467,"glosses":["parcel","package","chump, useless, butterfingers (an incompetent person)"],"ipa":"/paˈkete/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"paquetes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-paquete.wav","examples":[{"text":"Recibimos un gran paquete.","en":"We received a large package.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735629"},{"text":"¿Puedes con esos paquetes tú solo?","en":"Can you manage those packages by yourself?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/560103"},{"text":"Tengo un paquete para Tom.","en":"I have a package for Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/222200"},{"text":"Cosas buenas vienen en paquetes pequeños.","en":"Good things come in small packages."},{"text":"Una factura acompañaba al paquete.","en":"A bill came along with the package.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687212"}]}